<title>USA: Arco Says Calif. coker to return in 10 days.</title>
<headline>Arco Says Calif. coker to return in 10 days.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlantic Richfield Co said on Wednesday it plans to restart in about 10 days the number two coker at its 260,000 barrel-per-day refinery in Carson, Calif., following problems that have shut the unit for a week.</p>
</text>
